' Agentic Value Stream semantic anatomy ; CR-VAS-002
'
' Per CR-VAS-002 §17 + ES-ADR-052 + ADR-ES-005 §16.
' Illustrates the seven required values, seven exclusion conditions,
' materiality, and the four boundary assertions preserved against
' Agentic Value Stage, Agentic Workflow, Agentic Operations, and
' Autonomous Value Stream.
'
' Authored by: Emmanuel A. Otchere (cardinal author rule, 2026-09-23)
' Date: 2026-10-07
' Governance: enterprise-semantics

@startuml agentic-value-stream-semantic-anatomy

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F0F8FF
    BorderColor #4682B4
    FontStyle bold
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFACD
    BorderColor #DAA520
}

rectangle "Agentic Value Stream\n(ES:CONCEPT:agentic-value-stream)" as AVS #E6F3FF

rectangle "Required values\n(AVS-VAL-01..07)" as REQ #90EE90
rectangle "Not required\n(AVS-NRQ-01..07)" as NRQ #FFE4E1
rectangle "Exclusion conditions\n(AVS-EXC-01..07)" as EXC #FFB6C1
rectangle "Materiality\n(AVS-MAT-01..03)" as MAT #FFFACD
rectangle "Invariants\n(AVS-INV-001..013)" as INV #E0E0FF
rectangle "Edge cases\n(AVS-EDGE-01..05)" as EDG #F0E0FF

AVS --> REQ : "must satisfy all"
AVS --> EXC : "none may hold"
AVS --> MAT : "must hold"
AVS --> NRQ : "absence does not disqualify"

REQ --> INV : "each AVS-VAL enforces an AVS-INV"
EXC --> INV : "each AVS-EXC enforces an AVS-INV"
MAT --> INV : "each AVS-MAT enforces an AVS-INV"

EDG --> AVS : "compositional arrangements\nthat still qualify"

note right of AVS
  Specialises Value Stream (ES:CONCEPT:value-stream)
  AI not required ; Automation not required ; Autonomy not required
  Human intervention legitimate
  Cardinal author rule preserved
end note

note bottom of EXC
  Boundary preserved against:
  Agentic Value Stage (not introduced)
  Agentic Workflow (held)
  Agentic Operations (held)
  Autonomous Value Stream (separate concept)
end note

@enduml
